<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-ZABEL WINS TOUR DE FRANCE THIRD STAGE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-ZABEL WINS TOUR DE FRANCE THIRD STAGE.</headline>
<dateline>PLUMELEC, France 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Erik Zabel of Germany won the 224-km third stage of the Tour de France cycling race from Vire to Plumelec on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>Mario Cipollini of Italy retained the race leader's yellow jersey.</p>
